    "iOS 最多同时看 %lld 个地点，删掉一个才能再加。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS can watch up to %lld places at once. Delete one to add another."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOSが同時に見られる場所は%lld件までです。追加するには1つ削除してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……你好。你平时一天都怎么过？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…Hi. What are your days like?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……はじめまして。ふだん、どう過ごしてる？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……好，那就看你去哪儿。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…Okay. I'll go by where you are."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……行き先で決める。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……就这样。以后慢慢来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…That's it. We'll figure out the rest."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……これで。あとはゆっくり。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……就这样吧。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…That'll do."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……こんなもんか。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……新来的？你平时一天都在干嘛？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…New here? So what do your days look like?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……新入り？\nふだん何してんの？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……行，那我不管时间了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…Fine. I'll ignore the clock."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……時間は無視。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……这样可以吗？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…Is this okay?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……これで、どう？"
