    "「健身」从下班里拿出来，放进这张卡了。一件事只放一张卡。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Gym” moved from Chill to this card. Each thing lives on one card only."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「筋トレ」はオフから外して、このカードに入れました。ひとつのことはカード1枚にだけ入ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mon"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一天最多找你一次。早上不吵你。" : {
      "comment" : "onboarding",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once a day, max. No noise in the mornings."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "声かけるのは1日1回まで。\n朝は静かにしてる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一天最多跟你说一次话，早上不打扰。" : {
      "comment" : "onboarding，正常大小写",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I'll talk to you once a day at most. Never in the mornings."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "話しかけるのは1日1回まで。朝はそっとしとく。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一般几点睡呀？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When do you usually go to bed?"
