    "位置" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Location"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置权限不是「始终」：App 关着时不知道你到了或离开公司、家。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Location isn’t set to “Always,” so with the app closed it can’t tell when you reach or leave the office or home."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "位置情報が「常に」になっていないので、アプリを閉じている間は職場や家への出入りがわかりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置权限关着，定不了位。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Location access is off, so I can't find you."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位置情報がオフなので、現在地を取得できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你到了哪里，我就跟着换样子。可以让我知道你在哪吗？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wherever you go, I'll change to match. Can I know where you are?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行った場所で、私も格好を変える。場所、教えてくれる？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你到公司、回家，我自己换衣服。要知道你在哪。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You get to work, you get home, I change outfits. Mind telling me where you are?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会社と家、着いたら俺が着替える。だから場所がいる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你在走路还是坐车，我想跟着一起。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Walking or riding? I'd like to go along."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歩きか乗り物か。\n一緒に合わせたい。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的三张卡" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your three cards"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードは3枚"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的四张卡" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your four cards"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードは4枚"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你睡得好不好、有没有动一动，我想知道。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How you slept, whether you moved a little… I'd like to know."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "よく眠れたか、体を動かしたか。知りたい。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你睡得少我会困。你练完我会知道。要看看你的睡眠和运动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You sleep less, I get sleepy. You work out, I notice. Can I read your sleep and workouts?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そっちが寝不足だと俺も眠い。\n運動したらわかる。\n睡眠と運動、見せて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你认真活过的每一天，都不该白白消失。" : {
      "comment" : "产品原则的英文原句",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your life should leave traces."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ちゃんと過ごした毎日を、なかったことにしない。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你走路还是坐车，我想跟着演。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Walking or riding? I want to act it out."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歩きか乗り物か。\n俺もそれっぽくやる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
