    "到公司才切到上班。在上班的日子，下班前 %lld 分钟提醒一次。晚间延长打开后，下班后还在公司就托腮等到延长时间。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Work only starts when you get to the office. On work days, you get one reminder %lld minutes before the end of work. With late evenings on, if you're still at the office after hours, the character waits, chin in hand, until that time."
